### Sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client format).
### Start the server first:  IDE_API_KEYS=dev-admin-key:admin idengine serve
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@key = dev-admin-key

### Health (no key needed)
GET {{base}}/health

### Upload and process synchronously
POST {{base}}/v1/documents?wait=true
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY

--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invoice.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../tests/fixtures/golden/corpus/f_invoice.txt
--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

finance,invoices
--BOUNDARY--

### List documents (filters: status, category, language, doc_type, tag, q)
GET {{base}}/v1/documents?doc_type=txt&sort=created_at&order=desc&limit=20
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Hybrid search with a metadata filter
POST {{base}}/v1/search?include_text=false
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "late payment fee", "mode": "hybrid", "top_k": 5,
 "filters": {"tags": "finance", "document_date": {"$gte": "2024-01-01"}}}

### Ask a question (RAG with citations)
POST {{base}}/v1/ask
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What is the total amount due on invoice INV-7781?"}

### Summarise free text
POST {{base}}/v1/summarize
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Paste a long text here. It will be summarised with TextRank.", "max_sentences": 2}

### Train the classifier (admin)
POST {{base}}/v1/classifier/train
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"algorithm": "naive_bayes", "test_ratio": 0.25, "examples": [
  {"label": "finance", "text": "Pay the invoice within thirty days."},
  {"label": "finance", "text": "The budget caps travel spending."},
  {"label": "legal", "text": "This agreement is governed by Delaware law."},
  {"label": "legal", "text": "The tenant may terminate the lease with notice."}
]}

### Rebuild indexes in the background (admin)
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/reindex
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"refit": true, "background": true}

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{base}}/metrics
X-API-Key: {{key}}
